      "side": 1,
      "message": "The bug this patch is trying to fix is SPI flash access over CCD. Without the fix, SPI transactions are started before the EC is held in reset and the EC interferes on the SPI bus (through the AP). So at least the path through enable_ap_spi() needs to block until the EC and AP are definitely in reset.\n\nI think it\u0027s better to have a 30 ms blocking action that effects all users of assert_ec_rst() on Wilco. The cr50 code shouldn\u0027t have much other work to do since we\u0027re putting the EC and AP into reset.",
